00:20:31.530 --> 00:20:34.233
as an advisor, I worked
with Karl Rove directly,

00:20:34.233 --> 00:20:37.869 line:0%
and I worked with Obama for
eight years on this matter,

00:20:37.869 --> 00:20:40.472 align:start size:94% position:6% line:0%
and I worked for president
Trump on this matter,

00:20:40.472 --> 00:20:41.873 line:0%
and other matters by the way.

00:20:41.873 --> 00:20:45.210
So here it is, wow,

00:20:45.210 --> 00:20:47.879
this is chaotic on
multiple levels.

00:20:47.879 --> 00:20:49.281
Let me lay it out for you.

00:20:49.281 --> 00:20:50.983 align:start size:84% position:16%
We have the ability
to solve this.

00:20:50.983 --> 00:20:52.251
We can solve this.

00:20:52.251 --> 00:20:55.187 align:start size:84% position:16%
The immigration crisis
is just the outcome

00:20:55.187 --> 00:20:58.190
of political expediencies
on both sides of the aisle.

00:20:59.424 --> 00:21:00.792
George W. Bush had
a great proposal,

00:21:00.792 --> 00:21:02.461 align:start size:84% position:16%
it should have
passed, didn't pass.

00:21:02.461 --> 00:21:04.830
A couple of people on
the Republican side

00:21:04.830 --> 00:21:07.432
put a halt on that
and that's a shame.

00:21:07.432 --> 00:21:08.800
During the Obama administration,

00:21:08.800 --> 00:21:11.703
President Obama made
healthcare a priority,

00:21:11.703 --> 00:21:15.007 align:start size:88% position:13%
sacrificed immigration,
and that's a shame.

00:21:15.007 --> 00:21:16.608
And he had two years,
by the way, to do it

00:21:16.608 --> 00:21:17.876 align:start size:84% position:16%
where he had control
of both Houses.

00:21:17.876 --> 00:21:19.077 align:start size:88% position:13%
- Yeah, he could have
done whatever he wanted.

00:21:19.077 --> 00:21:20.012
- He could have, boom.

00:21:20.012 --> 00:21:23.015
So this is the fault of, again,

00:21:23.015 --> 00:21:25.183
healthcare trumps immigration.

00:21:25.183 --> 00:21:26.818
President Trump,
and I was there,

00:21:26.818 --> 00:21:28.553
I was literally negotiating

00:21:28.553 --> 00:21:30.322
between the White
House and Congress.

00:21:30.322 --> 00:21:32.424
The president had me here

00:21:32.424 --> 00:21:33.358
and then I would go
across the street

00:21:33.358 --> 00:21:34.860
and speak to Speaker Pelosi.

00:21:34.860 --> 00:21:36.428
Speaker Pelosi would tell me
to go back to the White House.

00:21:36.428 --> 00:21:38.263
So I was negotiating
between the White House

00:21:38.263 --> 00:21:39.264
and Congress on this.

00:21:39.264 --> 00:21:40.499
There was a great deal.

00:21:40.499 --> 00:21:42.434
President Trump
even surprised me

00:21:42.434 --> 00:21:43.769
with the number of Dreamers.

00:21:43.769 --> 00:21:45.804
He increased it times two.

00:21:45.804 --> 00:21:48.774
he went from 800,000 to
1.6 million Dreamers.

00:21:48.774 --> 00:21:50.976
"Pastor Sam, we're
gonna give Dreamers

00:21:50.976 --> 00:21:53.679
a pathway to citizenship
as long as I get my wall,

00:21:55.113 --> 00:21:57.683 align:start size:97% position:3%
and protect the border and
stop all illegal immigration."

00:21:57.683 --> 00:22:00.185 align:start position:0%
And I went back to the speaker,
we negotiated something.

00:22:00.185 --> 00:22:01.920
And then Chuck Schumer
came along and said,

00:22:01.920 --> 00:22:04.456
"We're not gonna give
President Trump a win."

00:22:04.456 --> 00:22:06.191
Do your due diligence on this.

00:22:06.191 --> 00:22:07.826
It's been extensively covered.

00:22:07.826 --> 00:22:09.027
So, what do we do now?

00:22:09.027 --> 00:22:10.896 align:start size:88% position:13%
Right now on the border,
we have a crisis.

00:22:10.896 --> 00:22:12.564
Guess what?

00:22:12.564 --> 00:22:15.000 align:start size:84% position:16%
The cages were built
by President Obama's
administration.

00:22:15.000 --> 00:22:16.234 align:start size:94% position:6%
There it is.
- Yeah, it's just a fact.

00:22:16.234 --> 00:22:17.502 align:start size:81% position:19%
It's just a fact.
- The cages,

00:22:17.502 --> 00:22:19.104
they were from the
Obama administration.

00:22:19.104 --> 00:22:20.639
That's a matter of fact.

00:22:20.639 --> 00:22:22.708
Even the pictures that were
used against President Trump

00:22:22.708 --> 00:22:24.509 align:start size:84% position:16%
were from the Obama
administration.

00:22:24.509 --> 00:22:28.113
So, that's a lie that
became, not truth,

00:22:28.113 --> 00:22:31.149
that was perceived to
be truth by mass media.

00:22:31.149 --> 00:22:34.353 align:start size:94% position:6%
Currently right now,
they're in the same places

00:22:34.353 --> 00:22:38.423
that President Biden and
Kamala Harris spoke against

00:22:38.423 --> 00:22:40.225
in every single debate.

00:22:40.225 --> 00:22:42.361 align:start size:94% position:6%
They are actually putting
young men and women,

00:22:42.361 --> 00:22:44.629
boys and girls, in the
same identical places.

00:22:44.629 --> 00:22:47.532
I kid you not, the same
identical facilities

00:22:47.532 --> 00:22:49.601 align:start size:84% position:16%
with the same
identical conditions.

00:22:49.601 --> 00:22:50.902
- It actually seems far worse.

00:22:50.902 --> 00:22:53.572 align:start size:97% position:3%
Aren't they more packed now?
- It is.

00:22:53.572 --> 00:22:55.374
It's way more packed,
and I should know,

00:22:55.374 --> 00:22:58.110
I've traveled to these
centers, I've been there.

00:22:58.110 --> 00:22:59.478
I've interviewed,

00:22:59.478 --> 00:23:03.115
I've interviewed custom
border patrol agents.

00:23:03.115 --> 00:23:04.783 align:start size:84% position:16%
Many of them attend
our churches.

00:23:04.783 --> 00:23:06.485
So, I even did some sidebars.

00:23:06.485 --> 00:23:08.787
I went, "Hey, guys,
tell me the truth.

00:23:08.787 --> 00:23:10.589
Just as people of faith,

00:23:10.589 --> 00:23:12.457 align:start size:84% position:16%
please tell me the
truth off the record."

00:23:12.457 --> 00:23:15.594
They went, "Hey, hey, Pastor
Sam, we're not setting this up

00:23:15.594 --> 00:23:17.195
to try to convince
you of anything.

00:23:17.195 --> 00:23:18.363
This is the reality."

00:23:18.363 --> 00:23:19.831
So, I've been there.

00:23:19.831 --> 00:23:22.501 align:start size:97% position:3%
The reality is right now under
the Biden administration,

00:23:22.501 --> 00:23:24.035
there is a greater crisis

00:23:24.035 --> 00:23:26.972
than ever during the
Trump administration

00:23:26.972 --> 00:23:29.808
as it pertains to
children coming in.

00:23:29.808 --> 00:23:31.143
It is tragic.

00:23:31.143 --> 00:23:33.812
I mean, the stories
are heartbreaking.

00:23:33.812 --> 00:23:37.115
Babies, toddlers, we're
talking about toddlers.

00:23:38.083 --> 00:23:40.719
As a pastor and as a dad,

00:23:40.719 --> 00:23:43.588
it's heartbreaking
to see the images.

00:23:43.588 --> 00:23:45.624
And this is because the
Biden administration

00:23:45.624 --> 00:23:48.960 align:start size:88% position:13%
gave a wink and a nod
for people to come over.

00:23:48.960 --> 00:23:52.197
They did, they can't
deny it, they did,

00:23:52.197 --> 00:23:54.232 align:start size:84% position:16%
and now we're reaping
the consequences.

00:23:54.232 --> 00:23:58.770 align:start position:0%
But there is a solution and
here it is, here's the proposal.

00:23:58.770 --> 00:24:02.240
Number one, we need
to secure our border.

00:24:02.240 --> 00:24:03.708
We're a sovereign nation.

00:24:03.708 --> 00:24:05.444
Open borders doesn't work.

00:24:05.444 --> 00:24:08.814 align:start size:84% position:16%
Open borders invites
sex trafficking.

00:24:08.814 --> 00:24:10.849
The drug cartels,
they are smiling.

00:24:10.849 --> 00:24:13.151 align:start size:81% position:19%
The cartels are
smiling right now.

00:24:13.151 --> 00:24:17.088
This idea, this notion,
is so anti-American.

00:24:17.088 --> 00:24:18.890 align:start size:84% position:16%
And as a pastor
committed to ending

00:24:18.890 --> 00:24:20.759
human and sex trafficking,

00:24:20.759 --> 00:24:23.795
I repudiate what's currently
taking place at the border.

00:24:23.795 --> 00:24:25.564
We need to secure the border.

00:24:25.564 --> 00:24:27.766
Stop all illegal immigration.

00:24:27.766 --> 00:24:31.903 align:start size:94% position:6%
We want people coming here
legally, not illegally,

00:24:31.903 --> 00:24:34.372
and we can't have it both ways.

00:24:34.372 --> 00:24:37.509 align:start size:97% position:3%
We can't permit more people
coming here illegally,

00:24:37.509 --> 00:24:39.845 align:start size:94% position:6%
breaking the law, and
then we're telling people

00:24:39.845 --> 00:24:41.646
that they must wear a mask.

00:24:41.646 --> 00:24:42.848 align:start size:72% position:28%
Which is it?
- Right.

00:24:42.848 --> 00:24:44.549 align:start size:81% position:19%
- So there's a
segment of society

00:24:44.549 --> 00:24:46.284
that has to adhere to the law,

00:24:46.284 --> 00:24:47.853 align:start size:84% position:16%
yet there's a group
of individuals

00:24:47.853 --> 00:24:50.956 align:start size:94% position:6%
that don't have to adhere
to or obey the law.

00:24:50.956 --> 00:24:55.760 align:start size:88% position:13%
That lack of continuity
subconsciously
creates a construct

00:24:55.760 --> 00:25:00.432
which leads to behavior that
produces chaos and anarchy.

00:25:00.432 --> 00:25:02.234
A lack of coherency, right?

00:25:02.234 --> 00:25:03.835 align:start size:81% position:19%
So, we have to
make up our minds.

00:25:03.835 --> 00:25:06.104
Let's protect the border,
stop illegal immigration,

00:25:06.104 --> 00:25:08.974 align:start size:97% position:3%
and we can do it even not
just through a physical wall,

00:25:08.974 --> 00:25:11.843
infrared technology,
satellite imaging,

00:25:11.843 --> 00:25:13.645 align:start size:84% position:16%
come on, we could
read the license plate

00:25:13.645 --> 00:25:16.281 align:start size:94% position:6%
from a car in Afghanistan
from a satellite.

00:25:16.281 --> 00:25:18.717 align:start size:97% position:3%
We can stop thousands
crossing over the Rio Grande

00:25:18.717 --> 00:25:19.918
with backpacks.

00:25:19.918 --> 00:25:21.920 align:start size:84% position:16%
So, we have the
technology to do it.

00:25:21.920 --> 00:25:24.055
Let's do that, let's stop
all illegal immigration.

00:25:24.055 --> 00:25:26.324
The second thing we must
do is get the Dreamers

00:25:26.324 --> 00:25:30.228 align:start position:0%
on a pathway to become
citizens, just the Dreamers now.

00:25:30.228 --> 00:25:31.796
Because I still believe the kids

00:25:31.796 --> 00:25:33.665
should not pay for the
sins of their parents.

00:25:33.665 --> 00:25:35.600 align:start size:94% position:6%
Some of your audience
would disagree with that.

00:25:35.600 --> 00:25:37.168
I just find it to be logical.

00:25:37.168 --> 00:25:38.637
If you were brought over

00:25:38.637 --> 00:25:41.406 align:start position:0%
when you were three, four, five
years old, I mean, come on,

00:25:41.406 --> 00:25:42.240 align:start size:94% position:6%
did you vote on that? No.
- Right, and now

00:25:42.240 --> 00:25:43.742
you're 20 years old,

00:25:43.742 --> 00:25:45.010
and you're kicking these
people out of the country.

00:25:45.010 --> 00:25:45.944
- Yeah, yeah, and
you grew up here,

00:25:45.944 --> 00:25:47.178
you don't even speak Spanish.

00:25:47.178 --> 00:25:49.414
You grew up in our
educational system.

00:25:50.282 --> 00:25:51.716
Let's find a pathway,

00:25:51.716 --> 00:25:54.519 align:start size:97% position:3%
as long as you're not involved
in nefarious activities,

00:25:54.519 --> 00:25:57.422 align:start size:97% position:3%
you're not involved in
gangs, et cetera, et cetera.

00:25:57.422 --> 00:25:59.024 align:start size:97% position:3%
Let's have these
individuals become citizens.

00:25:59.024 --> 00:26:02.060 align:start size:84% position:16%
But their parents,
that's where I differ,

00:26:02.060 --> 00:26:04.563 align:start size:84% position:16%
where I'm even maybe
too conservative

00:26:04.563 --> 00:26:07.098 align:start size:84% position:16%
for some of my
friends on the right.

00:26:07.098 --> 00:26:09.935 align:start size:97% position:3%
I don't think that the parents
who came here illegally

00:26:09.935 --> 00:26:11.570
should ever become citizens.

00:26:11.570 --> 00:26:13.605
- So what do you do with them?

00:26:13.605 --> 00:26:14.539
- There's a price to pay.

00:26:14.539 --> 00:26:15.774
We give them a green card.

00:26:15.774 --> 00:26:17.042
So this is what we do.

00:26:17.042 --> 00:26:18.777
If you're not living off
government entitlement,

00:26:18.777 --> 00:26:20.812 align:start size:84% position:16%
if you're not
living off welfare,

00:26:20.812 --> 00:26:22.480 align:start size:84% position:16%
and I know that
you're probably using

00:26:22.480 --> 00:26:24.716 align:start size:94% position:6%
false social security
numbers, that is a crime.

00:26:24.716 --> 00:26:26.618
You're going to have
to recognize the fact

00:26:26.618 --> 00:26:29.554
that you broke the law, that
you have been breaking the law,

00:26:29.554 --> 00:26:31.790
you should be paying some fines,

00:26:31.790 --> 00:26:34.693 align:start size:88% position:13%
but you've been here for
20, 25 years working,

00:26:34.693 --> 00:26:36.161
and some of these individuals

00:26:36.161 --> 00:26:37.696 align:start size:97% position:3%
are some of the hardest
working individuals I know.

00:26:37.696 --> 00:26:39.698
I live in California,
so that's just true.

00:26:39.698 --> 00:26:41.700
I'm just speaking
truth to power.

00:26:41.700 --> 00:26:43.301
And they attend our churches,

00:26:43.301 --> 00:26:44.769 align:start size:94% position:6%
some of the most beautiful
people on the planet.

00:26:44.769 --> 00:26:46.605 align:start size:94% position:6%
They should have come
here legally, by the way.

00:26:46.605 --> 00:26:48.573
All right, did that ship sail?

00:26:48.573 --> 00:26:50.609
Yes, but there's a price to pay.

00:26:50.609 --> 00:26:51.876
We're gonna give
you a green card.

00:26:51.876 --> 00:26:53.111
Stay in America.

00:26:53.111 --> 00:26:55.614
You no longer have to
fear being deported,

00:26:55.614 --> 00:26:58.049 align:start size:84% position:16%
but you're never gonna
become a citizen.

00:26:58.049 --> 00:26:59.684
There's a price to pay.

00:26:59.684 --> 00:27:03.021
How in the world can
we compensate people

00:27:03.021 --> 00:27:05.557 align:start size:88% position:13%
that came here illegally
with citizenship,

00:27:05.557 --> 00:27:07.792
for crying out loud,
when there are people

00:27:07.792 --> 00:27:10.996 align:start size:81% position:19%
waiting in line
legally in nations

00:27:10.996 --> 00:27:14.366 align:start size:97% position:3%
attempting to come into
this country the right way.

00:27:14.366 --> 00:27:15.634
It's just wrong.

00:27:15.634 --> 00:27:18.503
So my proposal, which I
gave to President Trump

00:27:18.503 --> 00:27:20.338
and I gave it to a
number of senators

00:27:20.338 --> 00:27:22.540
that are just close friends,

00:27:22.540 --> 00:27:23.808 align:start size:84% position:16%
I said, "Here,
here's the proposal."

00:27:23.808 --> 00:27:26.578 align:start size:84% position:16%
I call it a just
integration solution,

00:27:26.578 --> 00:27:27.912
and I think the vast majority

00:27:27.912 --> 00:27:29.180
of Americans would embrace this.

00:27:29.180 --> 00:27:30.649
And matter of fact, I know,

00:27:30.649 --> 00:27:31.950
because we did some polling
and they actually would,

00:27:31.950 --> 00:27:34.819
including members of
the Freedom Caucus,

00:27:34.819 --> 00:27:36.554
the most conservative
individuals who say,

00:27:36.554 --> 00:27:39.257
"That sounds fair,
that sounds fair."

00:27:39.257 --> 00:27:40.425
- All right, there's
a lotta different ways

00:27:40.425 --> 00:27:41.893
we could go here.

00:27:41.893 --> 00:27:43.928
So what do you think the wink
that you're talking about,

00:27:43.928 --> 00:27:45.730
the Biden administration wink,

00:27:45.730 --> 00:27:48.700
what do you think it
really is all about?

00:27:48.700 --> 00:27:50.468
'Cause they're kinda
like, "Don't come,

00:27:50.468 --> 00:27:52.437 align:start size:94% position:6%
maybe come in a few weeks,
you can kinda come."

00:27:52.437 --> 00:27:53.605 align:start size:84% position:16%
But what do you think
they're actually

00:27:53.605 --> 00:27:54.939 align:start size:84% position:16%
trying to accomplish
with the wink?

00:27:54.939 --> 00:27:56.541
Are they trying to get
all these people there?

00:27:56.541 --> 00:27:58.543
And do they have any
intention of actually

00:27:58.543 --> 00:28:00.945
doing what you said, which is
we've got to secure a border

00:28:00.945 --> 00:28:03.648
and it's the right of every
sovereign nation to do so?

00:28:03.648 --> 00:28:05.650
- No, I don't think,

00:28:05.650 --> 00:28:06.851
and I say this with
with due deference,

00:28:06.851 --> 00:28:08.186 align:start size:84% position:16%
I don't think the
current administration

00:28:08.186 --> 00:28:10.088
has any viable commitment.

00:28:10.088 --> 00:28:11.289
I can't measure it.

00:28:11.289 --> 00:28:13.458
If you can't measure
it, then it's not legit

00:28:13.458 --> 00:28:15.293
as it pertains to this outcome.

00:28:15.293 --> 00:28:17.862
I don't see any sort of evidence

00:28:17.862 --> 00:28:19.197 align:start size:88% position:13%
that this administration
is committed

00:28:19.197 --> 00:28:21.933 align:start size:97% position:3%
to protecting the
sovereignty of America, none.

00:28:23.468 --> 00:28:26.137
There are many open
border operatives

00:28:26.137 --> 00:28:28.673 align:start size:84% position:16%
that come from the
hard ideological left,

00:28:28.673 --> 00:28:30.408
and right now, unfortunately,

00:28:30.408 --> 00:28:32.977
they seem to have the
ear of our president.

00:28:32.977 --> 00:28:35.613
And it is unfortunate, it is.

00:28:35.613 --> 00:28:38.016 align:start size:94% position:6%
So I think the objective,
there's two-fold.

00:28:38.016 --> 00:28:39.417
There are those,

00:28:39.417 --> 00:28:41.152 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I can't judge
everyone across the board,

00:28:41.152 --> 00:28:43.154 align:start size:84% position:16%
I'm looking at
political outcomes,

00:28:43.154 --> 00:28:45.323
there is a group of individuals

00:28:45.323 --> 00:28:47.358
that really with a great heart

00:28:47.358 --> 00:28:49.694
would love to see America emerge

00:28:49.694 --> 00:28:52.230
as the phrase on the
Statue of Liberty,

00:28:53.098 --> 00:28:56.301
the place of refuge and hope

00:28:56.301 --> 00:28:58.203 align:start size:88% position:13%
for people that are
broken around the world.

00:28:58.203 --> 00:28:59.504
But that's utopia.

00:29:00.672 --> 00:29:02.841 align:start size:84% position:16%
We can't open up for
the entire world.

00:29:02.841 --> 00:29:04.743 align:start size:81% position:19%
We just don't have
the bandwidth.

00:29:04.743 --> 00:29:06.144
We're not the New Jerusalem,

00:29:06.144 --> 00:29:08.847 align:start size:88% position:13%
if you're an evangelical
or a Christian.

00:29:08.847 --> 00:29:11.750 align:start size:88% position:13%
This is not heaven, this
is not the new earth,

00:29:11.750 --> 00:29:14.252
whatever you wanna call it in
your theological worldview,

00:29:14.252 --> 00:29:16.755
we're not there, so we can't.

00:29:16.755 --> 00:29:18.757
We have to protect our borders.

00:29:18.757 --> 00:29:19.958
The second thing is,

00:29:19.958 --> 00:29:23.027 align:start size:88% position:13%
and this seems a little
bit more complicit,

00:29:23.027 --> 00:29:24.696
but I know this
from conversation

00:29:24.696 --> 00:29:27.398
with leadership
on the hard left,

00:29:27.398 --> 00:29:31.536 align:start size:97% position:3%
