00:29:32.937 --> 00:29:35.507 align:start size:88% position:13%
And it sounds, "Oh,
that's just wild, Sam."

00:29:35.507 --> 00:29:36.975 line:0%
No, it isn't.

00:29:36.975 --> 00:29:38.943 align:start size:97% position:3% line:0%
