to the reality

00:36:26.150 --> 00:36:28.486 align:start size:84% position:16%
that with that
resurrection power,

00:36:28.486 --> 00:36:30.588 align:start size:84% position:16%
Romans 8:11, the
apostle Paul writing,

00:36:30.588 --> 00:36:34.392 align:start position:0%
said the same Spirit that
resurrected Jesus lives in you,

00:36:34.392 --> 00:36:35.993
we can come out of despair.

00:36:35.993 --> 00:36:38.863 align:start size:97% position:3%
We can come out of anxiety,
fear, confusion, chaos.

00:36:38.863 --> 00:36:40.998
We can come out of brokenness.

00:36:40.998 --> 00:36:44.135 align:start size:97% position:3%
We can come out of the
most dire of circumstances.

00:36:44.135 --> 00:36:45.503
Jesus came out of the tomb.

00:36:45.503 --> 00:36:47.805
You and I can come out
of the most precarious,

00:36:47.805 --> 00:36:50.641 align:start size:88% position:13%
