circumstances by faith.

00:36:50.641 --> 00:36:52.610
That's the resurrection message,

00:36:52.610 --> 00:36:54.979 align:start size:94% position:6%
that there is eternal life
through the vicarious,

00:36:54.979 --> 00:36:56.314
atoning work of Christ

00:36:57.448 --> 00:36:59.417 align:start size:84% position:16%
and there's life even
beyond this life.

00:36:59.417 --> 00:37:01.852 align:start size:84% position:16%
But when we're on
this side of eternity,

00:37:01.852 --> 00:37:04.021
