00:37:12.330 --> 00:37:14.465
I really believe that through
that resurrection message,

00:37:14.465 --> 00:37:16.934
we can change the world.

00:37:16.934 --> 00:37:19.470 align:start size:81% position:19%
- Do you ever have
doubts anymore?

00:37:19.470 --> 00:37:24.275
- Yeah, absolutely, and to say
