00:37:24.275 --> 00:37:28.079 align:start size:84% position:16%
Yes, and this is
gonna sound awkward,

00:37:28.079 --> 00:37:32.216
I embrace them because it
reminds me of my humanity

00:37:32.216 --> 00:37:37.221 align:start position:0%
