00:38:30.775 --> 00:38:31.642
Were you paying-

00:38:33.344 --> 00:38:34.879
- Full disclosure, I'm a fan.

00:38:34.879 --> 00:38:37.014
- Oh, okay, all right, well,
then that's a perfect segue,

00:38:37.014 --> 00:38:39.183 align:start size:84% position:16%
because as you bring
up Adam and Eve,

00:38:39.183 --> 00:38:40.951
and we can talk obviously
