00:38:40.951 --> 00:38:43.321 align:start size:88% position:13%
he did so much on
these biblical stories.

00:38:43.321 --> 00:38:45.122
And what I saw that
was so fascinating

00:38:45.122 --> 00:38:46.624
when I was on tour with him

00:38:46.624 --> 00:38:49.126
was that people who
were not religious,

00:38:50.261 --> 00:38:51.495
they were either
atheist or agnostic

00:38:51.495 --> 00:38:52.863
or just sort of a-religious

00:38:52.863 --> 00:38:54.598 align:start size:84% position:16%
or hadn't really
thought about it much,

00:38:54.598 --> 00:38:57.234 align:start size:97% position:3%
suddenly they're hearing
him talk about these stories

00:38:57.234 --> 00:38:59.303 align:start size:84% position:16%
that they kinda
know through culture

00:38:59.303 --> 00:39:01.972
or maybe some religious
teaching or something,

00:39:01.972 --> 00:39:03.474
and it was changing them,

00:39:03.474 --> 00:39:06.911
and it was just incredible for
me to see night after night.

00:39:06.911 --> 00:39:11.182
- No, these narratives of
Scripture are full of truth

00:39:11.182 --> 00:39:15.086
and virtue and life lessons
that are eternal, eternal.

00:39:16.253 --> 00:39:18.289 align:start size:84% position:16%
To this very moment,
this very hour,

00:39:18.289 --> 00:39:19.924
if we pass these teachings down

00:39:19.924 --> 00:39:23.060
from one generation
to the other, there's
hope for the next.

00:39:23.060 --> 00:39:24.362
- Indeed.

00:39:24.362 --> 00:39:26.364 align:start size:84% position:16%
What else is on
your mind right now,

00:39:26.364 --> 00:39:29.300 align:start size:88% position:13%
not only as a preacher,
but as a leader,

00:39:29.300 --> 00:39:31.769
as someone involved in
the political world?

00:39:31.769 --> 00:39:33.804 align:start size:94% position:6%
And what else are you
thinking about right now?

00:39:34.872 --> 00:39:36.107
- I am concerned.

00:39:36.107 --> 00:39:37.475
I actually spoke to
my wife about this

00:39:37.475 --> 00:39:40.311 align:start size:88% position:13%
