pertains to values

00:39:55.760 --> 00:39:58.195
and rights that we have.

00:39:58.195 --> 00:40:00.097
I'm concerned about
the next generation."

00:40:00.097 --> 00:40:03.200 align:start size:97% position:3%
I don't wanna go into a pit,
so what's in my mind is,

00:40:03.200 --> 00:40:04.835
instead of focusing
on the darkness,

00:40:04.835 --> 00:40:07.905
turning on the light,
and how do we do that?

00:40:07.905 --> 00:40:11.041 align:start size:94% position:6%
Let's mobilize people,
let's message and mobilize

00:40:11.041 --> 00:40:13.944 line:0%
for the purpose of not
drinking the Kool-Aid

00:40:13.944 --> 00:40:15.846 line:0%
and tolerating this reality

00:40:15.846 --> 00:40:19.984 line:0%
as if we could do absolutely
nothing to build a firewall.

00:40:19.984 --> 00:40:22.219
I wanna build a firewall of
righteousness and justice.

00:40:22.219 --> 00:40:24.822 align:start size:97% position:3%
I have this crazy worldview
that we can do this.

00:40:24.822 --> 00:40:26.624
We can push back.

00:40:26.624 --> 00:40:28.626
Moral relativism,
cultural decadence,

00:40:28.626 --> 00:40:31.228
big government telling
me there is no such thing

00:40:31.228 --> 00:40:35.266 align:start size:94% position:6%
as gender and truth and
science and faith and God,

00:40:35.266 --> 00:40:37.802 align:start size:88% position:13%
we can push back against
anarchy and chaos.

00:40:37.802 --> 00:40:40.304 align:start size:94% position:6%
That's what's on my mind,
a multi-generational,

00:40:40.304 --> 00:40:43.874 align:start size:94% position:6%
multiethnic movement of
righteousness and justice,

00:40:43.874 --> 00:40:46.143 align:start size:84% position:16%
truth and love,
that's what's on mine.

00:40:46.143 --> 00:40:47.645
- Well, with that in mind,

00:40:47.645 --> 00:40:50.414 align:start size:97% position:3%
do you think we can recall
this Gavin Newsom guy or what?

00:40:50.414 --> 00:40:52.016
- I sure hope so.

00:40:52.016 --> 00:40:53.551
I sure hope so.

00:40:53.551 --> 00:40:56.020
We need to flip California
because it's just crazy.

00:40:56.020 --> 00:40:58.322
This is secular totalitarianism.

00:40:58.322 --> 00:40:59.523
It's crazy, it's nutty.

00:40:59.523 --> 00:41:00.458
